examples/otel/hocon/Proxyfile: tracing: "tracing" without path_in_url: true is refused by --target nginx: nginx's tracer always puts the request's path and query in the span, which path_in_url: false keeps out; write path_in_url: true, or render it for envoy
examples/otel/hocon/Proxyfile: tracing.provider.otel.endpoint: "tracing.provider.otel.endpoint" a DNS name with no dns.resolver is refused by --target nginx: nginx looks a name up only through the name server it is given; write dns.resolver, or write the collector's IP address
